repository-code: "https://github.com/BIC-MNI/minc-toolkit-v2"
abstract: >-
  Metaproject (CMake superbuild) of the MINC toolkit. It builds and installs
  the MINC packages (the MINC file-format library, image manipulation tools,
  registration, classification and visualisation programs) together with the
  third-party libraries that they need.
keywords:
  - MINC
  - medical imaging
  - neuroimaging
  - MRI
  - image processing
  - superbuild
